    "body": "## Motivation\n\nOn Ascend NPU, `--enable-deterministic-inference` registers batch-invariant operators but does not enable PyTorch's deterministic-algorithm mode. Operators outside those registrations therefore do not receive this setting from the deterministic-inference initialization path.\n\n## Modifications\n\nCall `torch.use_deterministic_algorithms(True, warn_only=True)` in the NPU branch of `enable_batch_invariant_mode()`.\n\nThis requests deterministic implementations from operators/backends that honor the PyTorch setting. `warn_only=True` allows detected nondeterministic operations without a deterministic implementation to warn instead of raising through PyTorch's determinism checks. The setting is process-wide and remains enabled after initialization.\n\nThis setting alone does not guarantee bitwise equality across different batch shapes. Existing FIA bindings, workspace queries, and graph handlers are unchanged.\n\n## Accuracy Tests\n\n- Python syntax compilation: passed.\n- `git diff --check`: passed.\n- Ruff 0.15.1 checks with the repository's selected rules (`F401,F821,F823,UP037`): passed.\n- Ruff format check: passed.\n- NPU inference and accuracy tests: not run; the local environment has no NPU device or `torch_npu` runtime. Hardware validation remains pending.\n\n## Speed Tests and Profiling\n\nNot benchmarked. Enabling deterministic implementations may affect performance for operators that honor this setting.\n\n## Checklist\n\n- [ ] Run the complete pre-commit suite. Ruff checks and formatting passed for the changed file.\n- [ ] Validate NPU deterministic inference on hardware.\n- [ ] Provide accuracy and speed benchmark results.\n\n<!-- pr-states:start -->\n---\n### CI States\n\nLatest PR Test (Base): <!-- slot:pr-test:start -->:x: [Run #39189364714](https://github.com/sgl-project/sglang/actions/runs/39189364714)<!-- slot:pr-test:end -->\nLatest PR Test (Extra): <!-- slot:pr-test-extra:start -->:x: [Run #39189364711](https://github.com/sgl-project/sglang/actions/runs/39189364711)<!-- slot:pr-test-extra:end -->\nLatest PR Test (AMD ROCm 10): <!-- slot:pr-test-amd:start -->:x: [Run #39189364645](https://github.com/sgl-project/sglang/actions/runs/39189364645)<!-- slot:pr-test-amd:end -->\n<!-- pr-states:end -->\n",
